{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1479416-world-of-darkness-unbound","id":1479416,"title":"World of Darkness Unbound","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-24T04:11:45-07:00","id":1479416,"title":"World of Darkness Unbound","content":"Well, Vampire the Masquerade only but still. Paradox gave their licence freely for independent video game developers to create games based on V:tM 5th edition for their share of profits. So if any of you ever wanted to create such game here it is:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/unbound\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/unbound\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/unbound\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.worldofdarkness.com/unbound </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> As I write this there are a few games already created. Some of them I'm afraid of (a comedy point-n-click adventure \ud83d\ude36) but still I'm full of hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 04-24-2022, 10:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-24T09:00:07-07:00","id":1479425,"title":"","content":"I haven't played any of them yet, but Heartless Lullaby is a great game (so much so it was voted to become an official product) and I've heard similar good things of the runner-ups from Vampire Jam that didn't win.<br /> <br /> I think this will be very positive for the community, especially starting developers or those that have it as a hobby. Being able to make a game of a setting you love makes things way easier, or at least would have for me if I still had interest in game development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27145-setitefriend","name":"SetiteFriend","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-24T13:48:14-07:00","id":1479440,"title":"","content":"Well, I have to admit that I haven't too. First of all I'm still not sure if I like 5th edition or not. The changes in the setting are interesting but with that many secret societies and cults V:tM slowly starts to look like Call of Cthulhu. The conversion of the characters from older editions is a little difficult and me and my players don't want to create new characters with every edition. Also I saw many things I consider stupid (but still It's my own opinion) created by other players and storytellers so I will approach those games cautiously. But I used to convert WoD video games (especially the unreleased ones) as an inspiration for traditional p&amp;p games so maybe I will find at least some of them useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrio